| Feature | `toRawSql()` | `DB::listen()` |
|---	  |	      ---|	       ---|
| Main purpose | Inspect a particular query builder | Observe queries executed during a request |
| Shows query before execution | Yes | No; it reports queries as they execute |
| Shows actual executed query events | No | Yes |
| Captures eager-loading queries automatically | No | Yes, if the listener is registered before they execute |
| Captures pagination count queries | Not from the main builder alone | Yes, if they execute while the listener is active |
